{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31572","headline":"送崔使君萧山祷雨甘泽遽降 · 李羣玉","name":"送崔使君萧山祷雨甘泽遽降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公一拜敬亭祠，五马旋归下散丝。\n不假土龙呈夭矫，自然石燕起参差。\n预听禾稼如云语，应有空蒙似雾时。\n已向爲霖报消息，颍川徵诏是前期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}